Keepalive next task (Codex) / Codex (keepalive)	UNKNOWN STEP	### Scope
Keepalive next task (Codex) / Codex (keepalive)	UNKNOWN STEP	In `src/lms/graphs/repository.py`, `create_knowledge_edge` checks `if edge_type in ORDERING_EDGE_TYPES and _ordering_edge_closes_cycle(...)` to ensure prerequisite learning graphs remain acyclic directed acyclic graphs (DAGs). However, `update_knowledge_edge` allows mutating an existing edge's `edge_type` without running `_ordering_edge_closes_cycle`. An author or API caller can update an existing non-ordering edge (such as `"analogy"`, `"contrast"`, or `"transfer-context"`) to an ordering edge type (such as `"prerequisite"` or `"key-prerequisite"`), closing a cycle in the prerequisite graph and breaking downstream topological schedulers and mastery traversals.
Keepalive next task (Codex) / Codex (keepalive)	UNKNOWN STEP	
Keepalive next task (Codex) / Codex (keepalive)	UNKNOWN STEP	### Tasks
Keepalive next task (Codex) / Codex (keepalive)	UNKNOWN STEP	Complete these in order. Mark checkbox done ONLY after implementation is verified:
Keepalive next task (Codex) / Codex (keepalive)	UNKNOWN STEP	
Keepalive next task (Codex) / Codex (keepalive)	UNKNOWN STEP	1. [ ] In `src/lms/graphs/repository.py`, update `update_knowledge_edge` so that if `edge_type` is changed to a member of `ORDERING_EDGE_TYPES`, it validates `_ordering_edge_closes_cycle(session, source_node_id=edge.source_node_id, target_node_id=edge.target_node_id, scope=edge.source_scope)` (excluding the edge itself from the visited path check if already present), raising `ValueError("edge would create a prerequisite cycle")` if a cycle is formed.
Keepalive next task (Codex) / Codex (keepalive)	UNKNOWN STEP	2. [ ] In `tests/graphs/test_edge_integrity.py` and `tests/api/test_knowledge_graph.py`, add test cases verifying that `PATCH /knowledge/edges/***edge_id***` and `update_knowledge_edge` reject edge type updates that would introduce a cycle with `HTTP 422 Unprocessable Entity` / `ValueError`.
Keepalive next task (Codex) / Codex (keepalive)	UNKNOWN STEP	
